scheme_of_work_details.two:
The student should be able to
a) explain how electric current produces a magnetic field;
b) identify the pattern of the magnetic field lines around a straight conductor

The student should be able to:
a) describe the structure of the nucleus of an atom;
b) explain the atomic number, mass number and isotopes of and atom

The student should be able to:
a)describe the construction of P-N junction;
b) Explain the mode of action of a P-N junction;
